<li><a href="https://www.lesman.com/siemens-milltronics-msi-single-idler-and-mmi-multi-idler-heavy-duty-belt-scales" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Siemens Milltronics MSI and MMI Belt Scales</a>, Lesman (Siemens distributor). ±0.5% single-idler and ±0.25% multi-idler accuracy.</li>
</ul>
